{'symbol': 'MET', 'date': '2022-05-05 10:30:00', 'title': "METLIFE EARNS 2022 ENERGY STAR® PARTNER OF THE YEAR ‘SUSTAINED EXCELLENCE' AWARD", 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #ENERGYSTAR--METLIFE HAS RECEIVED THE 2022 ENERGY STAR® PARTNER OF THE YEAR SUSTAINED EXCELLENCE AWARD FROM THE EPA AND THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY.'}